    "title": "Breeden sentenced in shooting case | Spencernews | wvnews.com",
    "text": "SPENCER, W.Va. — A man convicted in connection with the December 2024 shooting of Jazmine Cochrane was sentenced Monday, Aug. 17, in Roane County Circuit Court.\nScott Allen Breeden Jr. was sentenced to consecutive prison terms following his June 16 guilty plea to attempted murder, three counts of malicious assault and possession of a firearm by a prohibited person, according to a sentencing order filed in Roane County Circuit Court.",
